---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getProjectById } from '../../../data/projects';

const project = getProjectById('disaster-recovery');

if (!project) {
  throw new Error('Backup & Recovery project data could not be found.');
}
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Backup & Recovery Platform"
  description="A practical infrastructure resilience platform combining backup automation, recovery assurance, monitoring visibility and operational reporting."
>

<section class="project-hero">
<div class="container">
<p class="eyebrow">Infrastructure Resilience Case Study</p>

<h1>Backup & Recovery Platform</h1>

<p class="project-summary">
A practical resilience capability built around automated protection,
recovery confidence, monitoring visibility and operational reporting.
The objective was not simply creating backups, but proving recovery readiness.
</p>

</div>
</section>


<section class="section">
<div class="container content-grid">

<div>
<p class="eyebrow">The Challenge</p>
<h2>
Backups are only valuable when recovery confidence can be demonstrated.
</h2>
</div>

<div class="prose">

<p>
A backup completing successfully does not prove that an environment can
recover from failure.
</p>

<p>
The challenge was creating a platform that could provide evidence of
protection status, recovery readiness and operational health across a
multi-host infrastructure environment.
</p>

</div>

</div>
</section>


<section class="section section-soft">
<div class="container">

<p class="eyebrow">Engineering Approach</p>

<h2>
Moving from backup jobs to operational resilience.
</h2>

<div class="architecture">

<div>Backup Automation</div>
<div>Integrity Validation</div>
<div>Monitoring Integration</div>
<div>Operational Reporting</div>

</div>

</div>
</section>


<section class="section">

<div class="container">

<p class="eyebrow">Platform Capability</p>

<h2>
Building measurable recovery confidence.
</h2>


<div class="grid capability-grid">

<article class="card">
<h3>Backup Operations</h3>
<p>
Automated backup processes provide consistent recovery points across
managed infrastructure.
</p>
</article>


<article class="card">
<h3>Recovery Assurance</h3>
<p>
Validation processes improve confidence that backups remain usable when
they are required.
</p>
</article>


<article class="card">
<h3>Monitoring Visibility</h3>
<p>
Infrastructure health and resilience indicators are exposed through
monitoring dashboards.
</p>
</article>


<article class="card">
<h3>Operational Reporting</h3>
<p>
Technical state is converted into concise reporting suitable for
operational decision making.
</p>
</article>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<section class="section section-soft">

<div class="container">

<p class="eyebrow">Architecture</p>

<h2>
From infrastructure protection to management visibility.
</h2>


<div class="prose">

<p>
The platform connects technical recovery processes with operational
visibility.
</p>


<pre>
Infrastructure Hosts
        |
        v
Backup Automation
        |
        +---- Integrity Checks
        |
        +---- Recovery Validation
        |
        v
Monitoring Metrics
        |
        v
Dashboards & Reporting
</pre>


</div>

</div>

</section>


<section class="section">

<div class="container">

<p class="eyebrow">Operational Maturity</p>

<h2>
Making resilience visible and repeatable.
</h2>


<div class="prose">

<p>
<strong>Visibility:</strong>
Recovery readiness is exposed through monitoring rather than manual checks.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Assurance:</strong>
Backup health and recovery capability are measured.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Repeatability:</strong>
Automation reduces dependency on individual knowledge.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Ownership:</strong>
Operational reporting connects engineering outcomes with wider decisions.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<section class="section">

<div class="container">

<p class="eyebrow">Engineering Outcome</p>

<h2>
Resilience is a capability, not a backup task.
</h2>


<div class="prose">

<p>
This project demonstrates the difference between storing backup data and
building recovery confidence.
</p>

<p>
The outcome is a platform where protection status, recovery readiness and
operational health can be understood without relying on assumptions.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>


</BaseLayout>
